 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/code/modules/mob/living/carbon/human/species_types/roguetown/goblin/goblinp.dm b/code/modules/mob/living/carbon/human/species_types/roguetown/goblin/goblinp.dm
index 8adea93c76eb..d05f452ce0c9 100644
--- a/code/modules/mob/living/carbon/human/species_types/roguetown/goblin/goblinp.dm
+++ b/code/modules/mob/living/carbon/human/species_types/roguetown/goblin/goblinp.dm
@@ -4,13 +4,13 @@
 /datum/species/goblinp
 	name = "Goblin"
 	id = "goblinp"
-	desc = "<b>Goblin</b><br>\
-	A clever and stubborn nature are two charitable qualities of a goblin - scheming and selfish are less so. The Fell Gods use them as an avatar of malice, sending out \
-	mindless, enthralled waves of the creatures to attack civilization from lunar portals. It leaves the typical goblinoid to cloister in their hidden away tribes, stealing \
-	from the scraps out of fear of reprisal while shooing away outsiders. The cities of Man typically shun them, but it's not unheard of to see one pushing their luck in a \
-	town square or out on a well-traveled road, as even the most backwater peasant can tell the difference between a sapient one and portal-spawn. Usually.<br>\
-	(+1 Speed, Dark Vision Trait)"
-	species_traits = list(EYECOLOR,LIPS,STUBBLE)
+	desc = "<b>哥布林</b><br>\
+	若要替哥布林说点好话，“机灵”和“倔强”或许还算得上；至于“诡计多端”与“自私自利”，就没那么体面了。\
+	邪堂诸神将他们当作恶意的化身，从月亮传送门中驱出一波又一波失去心智、受其奴役的哥布林去袭击文明世界。\
+	这也让大多数哥布林只能蜇缩在隐秘的部落中，靠拾荒偷窃苟活，既惧怕报复，又驱赶外人。\
+	人类城市通常排斥他们，但偶尔也能见到某个哥布林在镇上广场或常走的道路上碰碰运气；\
+	毕竟就连最闭塞的乡下农夫，通常也分得清有理智的哥布林和从传送门里钻出来的怪物。通常如此。<br>\
+	(+1 速度, 黑暗视觉特性)"	
+	species_traits = list(EYECOLOR,LIPS,STUBBLE)
 	possible_ages = ALL_AGES_LIST
 	use_skintones = TRUE
 	skin_tone_wording = "Skin Color"
@@ -78,7 +78,7 @@
 		/datum/language/orcish
 	)
 	stress_examine = TRUE
-	stress_desc = span_red("Horrid little goblin...")
+	stress_desc = span_red("可憎的小地精……")
 	descriptor_choices = list(
 		/datum/descriptor_choice/height,
 		/datum/descriptor_choice/body,
